{
  "name": "CE-01 | Content Generation",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CE-01 | Content Generation\n**Trigger:** every 5 minutes (or click *Run now*).\n\n**Flow**\n1. Reads rows from the **Content** tab where `status = Ready` and takes **one** row.\n2. Sets it to `Generating` immediately (so nothing runs twice and a crash can't cause an endless loop).\n3. Loads your brand-voice row from the **Templates** tab (matched by `template_name`).\n4. Builds the prompt and calls **Gemini** (`generateContent`) asking for JSON: blog, YouTube title/description/tags, caption and a scene-by-scene video script.\n5. **QA gate** (Code node): valid JSON, blog length, keyword in title / first 100 words / density, banned phrases, scene count, spoken-line length.\n6. **Pass** -> content saved, status `Pending Approval`, you get an email.\n   **Fail** -> notes saved in `qa_notes`, `attempts` +1, status goes back to `Ready` (the next poll regenerates with the fixes included). After `maxAttempts` the status becomes `QA Failed` and you get an email.\n\n**Your approval step:** read the row, edit anything you like (even `script_json`), then change `status` to **Approved**. CE-02 picks it up from there.\n\n**Edit in Config node:** sheetId, notifyEmail, textModel, QA thresholds.",
        "height": 400,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "799cdb9b-3a3d-57a0-b06e-5e006cbad86d",
